- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Starlium Scythe
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when late fights are decided by surviving the first counter-engage after Selena commits in Abyssal Form.; Winter Crown over Holy Crystal when Use against Saber, Hayabusa, Ling, Natalia, or any hard punish that reaches Selena after the first dash.; Glowing Wand over Starlium Scythe when Use when sustain or shielding keeps marked targets alive and your team needs Lifebane more than the skill-to-basic burst.; Genius Wand over Starlium Scythe when Use when early flat Magic Defense reduction matters more than the enhanced basic attack window.
- Total cost: 12160 gold

Default mid build for turning one trap-arrow connection into a kill threat through Clock, Truncheon, and Starlium burst.

### Roam Dire Hit Pickoff (Roam)

